      435.2,
      295.37,
      481.28
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) thatthe Government intends to acquire the following land whichis required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      491.59,
      284.62,
      501.68
    ],
    "text": "Purpose of Acquisition: Knuckles Range Reservation:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      508.4,
      295.68,
      614.48
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called Kandhewaththa in total extentof about 2.8448 hectares depicted as lot 01 in the ParliminaryPlan No. Maha 6734 dated 08.09.2017 prepared by the SeniorSuperintendent of Surveys - Kandy District, situated in thevillage called Mangoda in the Grama Niladhari Division No.806 of Mangoda in the Udasiyapattuwa Korale Minor Divisionin the Divisional Secretary's Division of Medadumbara inKandy District of the Central Province and more fully describedas follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      347.6,
      547.09,
      405.68
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Kandhewaththa; Description: Scrub;Claimant:Y. M. Muthumenika, Y. M. Heen Banda, Y. M.Abeyrathna, Mangoda, Medhamahanuwara; Extent: 2.8448Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      416.48,
      547.62,
      510.56
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude arehereby required to appear personally, or by agents dulyauthorized in writing, before me at the Medadumbara DivisionalSecretariat on the 28 .02. 2018 at 02 .00 p.m. and are herebyrequested notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the21.02.2018, the nature of their interests in the aforesaid land/servitude, the particulars of their claims for compensationand the details of computation of such amount.",
